| Test: decodes three H.264 clips on the VideoCore (through VCHIQ and MMAL)
| and checks every picture against FFmpeg's own decode. Reports to Result.
WimpSlot -min 16384K -max 16384K
Remove <Obey$Dir>.Result
Run <Obey$Dir>.mmaldecode -o <Obey$Dir>.Result <Obey$Dir>.clips.small.stream <Obey$Dir>.clips.small.crc
Run <Obey$Dir>.mmaldecode -o <Obey$Dir>.Result <Obey$Dir>.clips.odd.stream <Obey$Dir>.clips.odd.crc
Run <Obey$Dir>.mmaldecode -o <Obey$Dir>.Result <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.stream <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.crc
